    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project: Num is a rhythm game centered around accuracy, combo, and the numpad. Hit appearing notes to the beat of the music and earn new highscores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614620/extras/5bcb2f4374a9ddd73c5b26ad2eca7a26.poster.avif?t=1752238224\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614620/extras/5bcb2f4374a9ddd73c5b26ad2eca7a26.webm?t=1752238224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614620/extras/5bcb2f4374a9ddd73c5b26ad2eca7a26.mp4?t=1752238224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the included levels with original songs or other players' custom maps. Customize your gameplay experience with modifiers that make the game easier or more difficult. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even create your own maps with custom songs easily with the built in editor. Then share your creations with other players. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project: Num is a rhythm game centered around accuracy, combo, and the numpad. Hit appearing notes to the beat of the music and earn new highscores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614620/extras/5bcb2f4374a9ddd73c5b26ad2eca7a26.poster.avif?t=1752238224\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614620/extras/5bcb2f4374a9ddd73c5b26ad2eca7a26.webm?t=1752238224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614620/extras/5bcb2f4374a9ddd73c5b26ad2eca7a26.mp4?t=1752238224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the included levels with original songs or other players' custom maps. Customize your gameplay experience with modifiers that make the game easier or more difficult. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even create your own maps with custom songs easily with the built in editor. Then share your creations with other players. </p>",
